PathingBehavior/CustomGoalProcess drop the client-only disconnect-on-arrival, PathingBehavior the vanilla auto-jump toggle
(a ServerPlayer has neither), LookBehavior reads the mouse sensitivity from IPlayerContext.mouseSensitivity(), MineProcess
asks ctx.entities() for dropped items instead of casting the world to ClientLevel.

